      "titleEn": "GPT-Red: Unlocking Self-Improvement for Robustness",
      "summaryZh": "探索GPT-Red，OpenAI的自动化红队系统，利用自我对弈提升AI安全性、对齐性和提示注入鲁棒性。",
      "summaryEn": "Explore GPT-Red, OpenAI's automated red teaming system that uses self-play to improve AI safety, alignment, and prompt injection robustness.",
      "keywords": [
        "GPT-Red",
        "红队",
