      "importanceReasonZh": "该消息来自Google官方，庆祝Google Images 25周年，并提及新的探索和创建视觉内容的方式，对产品发展和用户有实际影响。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "The news comes from Google official, celebrating the 25th anniversary of Google Images and mentioning new ways to explore and create visual content, which has practical impact on product development and users.",
