      "titleZh": "庆祝视觉搜索创新25周年",
      "titleEn": "Celebrating 25 years of visual search innovation",
      "summaryZh": "Google Images迎来25周年。回顾一些重要里程碑，以及探索和创建视觉内容的新方式。",
      "summaryEn": "Google Images is turning 25. Here’s a look back at some major milestones — and new ways to explore and create visual content.",
      "keywords": [],
